I am SO SO excited to announce my verbal commitment to further my academic and athletic career at D1 Rutgers University. 

First, I want to thank GOD for being with me every step of the way!

I want to thank my parents and grandparents for their unwavering support! I would not be where I am without them.

Thank you to my family, friends and ALL my coaches who traveled this journey with me!

@april.carroll.140 - I am very thankful for you taking me in at such a young age and pushing me to be the best version of myself.  You never held back because you knew my potential and how far I would go!! 💗 Shoutout to @a5gwinnett , Archer High School and @hebronvolleyball who have all played a BIG role in my volleyball journey by guiding, pushing, and pouring into me. 

Lastly, B1G thanks to Coach Caitlin, Coach Abby, Coach Robby, and Coach Ryan from the bottom of my heart for this amazing opportunity! 

GO SCARLET KNIGHTS!!

